{"id":"90","layout":"onecol","info":{"title":"Business days","headers":{"description":"A guide to London Stock Exchange business days and the impact on trading services of public and bank holidays.","keywords":"lseg stock prices","robots":null}},"meta":{"title":"Business days","page_type":null,"page_background":null,"available_languages":["en"],"language":"en","open_graph":{"og:description":"A guide to London Stock Exchange business days and the impact on trading services of public and bank holidays.","og:image":"","og:image:height":0,"og:image:width":0,"og:site_name":"","og:title":"Business days","og:type":"website"}},"components":[{"id":"block_content:e54ebd9e-2fbf-4be6-b60a-d153f4ab76b5","timestamp":null,"meta":{"columns":0,"title":"Business days - Content module 1","language":{"lang":"en","direction":"ltr"},"viewMode":"no_quick_links"},"position":"content","type":"content-module","weight":2,"staticContent":null,"content":[{"name":"empty","type":"CMS","value":{"uxPadding":null,"contentTitle":null,"contentSummary":null,"contentFullWidth":"0","contentWhiteBackgroundColumn":"0","contentTextColor":null,"contentTextSize":null,"contentBackgroundColor":"white","layout":"100","content":["<h2 class=\"text-align-justify\">What are our business days?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-justify\">London Stock Exchange generally operates its Trading Services each weekday. It does however, recognise the Public and Bank Holidays of England &amp; Wales and the impact on its Trading Services of these days are set out in the table below.&nbsp;London Stock Exchange will keep its days of operation under review.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe operational hours of each of our trading services is set out in the <a href=\"https://docs.londonstockexchange.com/sites/default/files/documents/20200401 MIT &amp; TE Parameters version 7.2.xls\" target=\"_blank\">Millennium Exchange &amp;&nbsp;TRADEcho&nbsp;Business Parameters Document</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-justify\">View the <a href=\"https://docs.londonstockexchange.com/sites/default/files/documents/settlement%20calendar-to-1-jan-2024.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Anticipated settlement calendar\">Anticipated settlement calendar</a> for all order book executions that has been produced in conjunction with the relevant CSD and CCPs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n"]}}],"datatypeFields":null,"isDataComponentAndIsAvailable":true},{"id":"block_content:09dcc1e6-2fcd-4f83-9bd2-0fe2a2f1ae44","timestamp":null,"meta":{"columns":0,"title":"Business days - Table 1","language":{"lang":"en","direction":"ltr"}},"position":"content","type":"table","weight":3,"staticContent":null,"content":[{"name":"empty","type":"CMS","value":{"uxPadding":"0","title":"Bank holidays and their impact on our trading services","summary":null,"table":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table class='table-with-headers'>\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">&nbsp;</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">&nbsp;</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">On Exchange Trading Services</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">OTC/SI Off-book trade reporting only</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Friday 7 April 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Good Friday</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day.<br />\r\n\t\t\tAlso GBX/ GBP NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Not available</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Monday 10 April 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Easter Monday</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day.<br />\r\n\t\t\tAlso GBX/ GBP NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Not available</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Monday 1 May 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Early May Bank Holiday</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day.<br />\r\n\t\t\tAlso GBX/ GBP NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Not available</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Monday 8&nbsp;May 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Bank Holiday for the coronation of King Charles III</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day.<br aria-hidden=\"true\" />\r\n\t\t\tAlso GBX/ GBP NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Available as normal</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Monday 29 May 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Spring Bank Holiday</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day.<br />\r\n\t\t\tAlso GBX/ GBP NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Available as normal</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Monday 28 August 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Summer Bank Holiday</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day.<br />\r\n\t\t\tAlso GBX/ GBP NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Available as normal</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Friday 22 December 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Christmas Holiday half day</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Markets closing process commences from 12:30 London time. Standard settlement day.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Available as normal</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Monday 25 December 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Christmas Day</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day. Also GBX/ GBP&nbsp;NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Not available</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Tuesday 26 December 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Boxing Day</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day. Also GBX/ GBP&nbsp;NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Available as normal</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Friday 29 December 2023</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>New Year Holiday half day</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Markets closing process commences from 12:30 London time. Standard settlement day.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Available as normal</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Monday 1 January 2024</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>New Year Day</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NON-trading day. Also GBX/ GBP&nbsp;NON-settlement day in EUI</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Not available</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}}],"datatypeFields":null,"isDataComponentAndIsAvailable":true},{"id":"block_content:fba41d1b-c2e3-43ce-a7f0-432ef1b59cc8","timestamp":null,"meta